WEBVTT

00:06:26.298 --> 00:06:30.678
smashing patriarchy every single time
she rode her motorcycle.

00:06:30.719 --> 00:06:35.307
She was an inspiration
for all women, young and old.

00:06:35.349 --> 00:06:36.684
And at the training camp,

00:06:36.684 --> 00:06:40.938
I saw how revving a motorbike
and holding a steering wheel

00:06:40.938 --> 00:06:43.524
didn’t [justt] give these women
the ability to drive

00:06:43.524 --> 00:06:47.236
but that much needed control
over their lives.

00:06:47.236 --> 00:06:53.159
And I knew instantly
that having women take charge

00:06:53.159 --> 00:06:54.827
and create change for themselves

00:06:54.869 --> 00:06:59.331
is the only way
to transform our broken systems.

00:06:59.373 --> 00:07:04.003
It got me thinking: What if we could
get communities of women moving,